                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "iRv6f",
                  "name": "規則文字",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": "$Space/sm-plus",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "MCBU1",
                      "name": "規則",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• 金額一律用等寬數字（monospace / tabular figures），對齊不抖動。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Body/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Primary",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Body/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "$Type/Body/Weight"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "RKeJF",
                      "name": "規則",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• 顯示精度隨金額大小折疊：小於 $10 顯示一位小數（$1.2）；$10–$999 顯示整數（$12、$123）；$1000 以上用 k 縮寫一位小數（$1.2k）。上限（分母）套同一規則。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Body/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Primary",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Body/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "$Type/Body/Weight"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "J0GDkB",
                      "name": "規則",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• 這套折疊規則讓最壞情況固定在 9–10 個字元（如 $9.9k/$99k），因此不需要 truncate、不需要 tooltip——格子寬度天生夠。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Body/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Primary",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Body/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "$Type/Body/Weight"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "xbMo5",
                      "name": "規則",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• 手機版（2×2 格）改為兩行：第一行「N 部失敗」，第二行金額「$12/$50」。若沒有失敗、只剩預算警示，金額升到第一行。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Body/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Primary",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Body/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "$Type/Body/Weight"
                    }
                  ]
                },
