                      "name": "s2k1",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "約束：accent 保留給進行中狀態（Sally 2026-07-05 裁決）；終局狀態一律 neutral。徽章標籤維持 3–4 個中文字。不新增色票。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Canvas",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "boXY9",
                      "name": "s2k2",
                      "fill": "$warning-text",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "原提案的 --accent 不存在於 styles.css。正確 token 是 --accent-text #e0be72，不是 --accent-primary #c9a24b：圖示是前景，而 #c9a24b 在 --bg-tertiary 上日巡只有 3.96:1，WCAG 1.4.11 非文字門檻是 3.0 —— 餘裕只剩 0.96，劇集列不帶自身背景，任何 hover／抬升表面就會讓它掉下去。--accent-text 最差 5.31:1，其 token 註解本就寫明是 AA-safe 前景色。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Canvas",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "A5nyHR",
                      "name": "s2k3",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "skipped 由 Minus 改為 CircleSlash（2026-08-04 裁定）：skipped 是定局，原本的裸字形把它歸進了「還沒到結論」家族，因而與 not_searched 渲染完全相同。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Canvas",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "BCBO4",
                      "name": "s2k4",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "no_text_source 與 skipped 的家族相似是刻意的：兩者都代表「這個檔案不會自動有字幕了」，使用者的下一步相同。必須一眼分開的是「定局 vs 還沒輪到」，理由細節由 tooltip 承擔 —— 不要把它們改成差異更大的字形。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Canvas",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "l0qvbf",
                      "name": "s2k5",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "untranslated 僅由生成管線寫入——內嵌英文軌單獨存在永不推導出它（外語片不欠翻譯）。復原＝設定翻譯金鑰後重跑：sub-2-2a 的續跑只執行翻譯段，不重付 ASR。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Canvas",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "M2q4vj",
                      "name": "s2k6",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "罕見情境：檔案已有繁中內嵌軌時仍顯示未翻譯（判定優先於軌道推導）——與 no_text_source／skipped 的一致性取捨，不視為缺陷。",
                      "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                      "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Canvas",
                      "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
