                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "會花錢的動作，控制項上一定帶預估金額。金額開頭的 $ 就是那個固定記號，不另加硬幣圖示。免費的動作不帶金額也不帶記號——沒有數字就是免費的訊號。",
                  "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                  "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Primary",
                  "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "OAvTa",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$text-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "記號之所以「固定」，是因為它跟按鈕能不能按綁在一起：只要按得下去，金額就一定在場。算不出金額時停用按鈕，把原因寫在說明列，而不是讓它退回成一顆看不出要錢的按鈕。",
                  "lineHeight": "$Type/Label/Line",
                  "fontFamily": "$Type/Family/Primary",
                  "fontSize": "$Type/Label/Size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
